 the ending.\n\nMost people just comply because they know fighting cops only stacks more charges.  \n\nSo, what\u2019s the point?  Pain,", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 21}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2096261291446837699", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATV8DOZ9i", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 27, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8819306, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1788638445954, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Boomstikchik", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATV8DOZ9i.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/PeteHegseth/status/2096261291446837699", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "It\u2019s simple: if Iran shoots at U.S. ships, we will destroy (and sink) their oil tankers. All they have to do is not shoot at @USNavy.\r\n\r\nIran\u2019s oil tanker fleet is defenseless \u2014 Iran has no navy or air force. Our planes, ships & subs can strike them all, in @CENTCOM & @USPACOM.", "last_comment_created": 1788639449091, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 27, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 0, "created": 1788619417000, "id": "2096247889366290840", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2096247838502211584/img/vhztJSJkRKWXQ83A.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2096247838502211584/pl/upUqFS2HVuiTB1in.m3u8?v=cfc", "aspectRatio": [16, 9], "heightRatio": 56, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2096247838502211584/vid/avc1/480x270/pA1q3QHclM8wfHMR.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1742575878226276352/NdNLF4K3_normal.jpg", "displayName": "U.S. Central Command", "username": "CENTCOM"}, "content": "\u201cLet the message to the IRGC be clear: If you shoot at two of our ships, we will impose an even higher economic cost \u2014taking out three of yours. We will not hesitate to defend American forces, and if necessary, destroy Iran\u2019s limited and exposed oil fleet.\u201d \u2014 Adm. Brad Cooper,", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 14149}, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 2341, "created": 1788622613000, "id": "2096261291446837699", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1892730921830223873/FnaA9xYs_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Pete Hegseth", "username": "PeteHegseth"}, "content": "It\u2019s simple: if Iran shoots at U.S. ships, we will destroy (and sink) their oil tankers. All they have to do is not shoot at @USNavy.\n\nIran\u2019s oil tanker fleet is defenseless \u2014 Iran has no navy or air force. Our planes, ships & subs can strike them all, in @CENTCOM & @USPACOM.", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 19351}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2096017136267178359", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATV8CH0FO", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 115, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8818672, "raw_content": "", "author": "rdvs34283", "created": 1788610024618, "profile_picture": "p9HQtdiLq2uP", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Elric44357", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored